From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:40:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] abox: build main_abox as binary

build the abox daemon as an executable binary instead of a shared
library
so that it is installed as /vendor/bin/main_abox, and isolate it in
its own soong namespace.
---
 abox/Android.bp | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/abox/Android.bp b/abox/Android.bp
index 64d4f15..1063a35 100644
--- a/abox/Android.bp
+++ b/abox/Android.bp
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
+soong_namespace {}
 
-cc_library {
+cc_binary {
     name: "main_abox",
     proprietary: true,
     srcs: ["main_abox.cpp"],
-- 
